.TH "COPY-SONG-URL.SH" "1" "November 2026" "arran4/dotfiles" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
copy\-song\-url.sh \- copy the currently playing media URL to the clipboard
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBcopy\-song\-url.sh\fR
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read xesam:url from go\-playerctl metadata, require an HTTP(S) URL, and copy it using wl\-copy, xclip or xsel (in that order). Print the URL on success.
.SH NOTES
Requires go\-playerctl and a supported clipboard program. Exits with an error if there is no shareable media URL.
.SH SEE ALSO
go\-playerctl(1)
